Domain Entity StudentIEPDisability
    documentation "The disabilities prescribed to a student as part of their IEP."
    association StudentIEPAssociation
        documentation "The student IEP for which the disability is prescribed."
        is part of identity
        merge StudentIEPAssociation.Student.StudentUniqueId with Student.StudentUniqueId
    domain entity EdFi.Student
        documentation "A reference to the student."
        is part of identity
    domain entity EdFi.EducationOrganization
        documentation "The identifier assigned to the education organization (usually District/LEA) providing IEP Services."
        is part of identity
        role name IEPServicing
    common EdFi.Disability
        documentation "The disability condition(s) that best describes an individual's impairment, as related to special education services received."
        is required collection